m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_38","text":"Sure enough, no response from Helm.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_39","text":"{AccountData.NickName} has sent you a gift card!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_40","text":"Wow.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_41","text":"Helm still isn't looking.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_42","text":"If we keep this up, Helm is gonna be super mad at us.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_43","text":"All right, Master Captain,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_44","text":"this is where you come in.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_45","text":"Helm is clearly just gazing at the notifications on her phone screen without paying real attention,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_46","text":"so you've gotta get her to actually click on the notifications and get back into the group chat.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_47","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_47","text":"Sorry, Helm.","jump":"m_ex_aegis_06_59"},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_48","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_48","text":"I'm quite fond of you, Helm.","jump":"m_ex_aegis_06_49"},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_49","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_50","text":"Looks like she's still not reading the messages.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_51","text":"She's probably just glancing at the notifications","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_52","text":"so that she doesn't give us the satisfaction of knowing she's seeing our messages.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_53","text":"Yeah, I'm inclined to agree.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_54","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_54","text":"Same here.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_55","text":"Then it's unanimous!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_56","text":"Helm is clearly lying on her bed using the notifications to steal glances at our messages without them showing up as \"read\".","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_57","text":"I can see her feet in the air right now, wiggling about with excitement.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_58","text":"*Clap clap clap clap clap*","jump":"m_ex_aegis_06_59"},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_59","text":"Oh!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"anchor_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_60","text":"She read the messages.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_aegis_06_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"helm","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_aegis_06_61","t